devotion to duty comes at the cost of time with his wife, Seetha, who longs for a child.

3
00:27:38,571 --> 00:27:44,571
His younger brother Raja falls in love with Lalitha, the daughter of a
corrupt shopkeeper who profits from exploiting the villagers.

4
00:36:51,428 --> 00:36:57,428
When Chinnathambi opens a fair-price cooperative store, tensions rise—and Lalitha’s
father seizes the opportunity to drive a wedge between the brothers.

5
00:46:04,285 --> 00:46:10,285
As family bonds are tested by love, rivalry, and personal sacrifice, the
women of the household stand at the heart of reconciliation.

6
00:55:17,142 --> 00:55:23,142
But when a twist of fate turns joy into sorrow, hidden truths and quiet
acts of love begin to shape the future of both couples.

